{"id":"279ca56a651294c7","group":"90","path":"90/90-cor-hypersimple-not-creative.md","title":"Hypersimple Not Creative","display":"cor-hypersimple-not-creative — Hypersimple Not Creative","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-cor-hypersimple-not-creative","aliases":["90-cor-hypersimple-not-creative"],"display":"cor-hypersimple-not-creative — Hypersimple Not Creative","depends_on":["[[90-df-hypersimple-set]]","[[90-df-creative-set]]","[[90-df-simple-set]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-thm-smn]]","[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-cor-hypersimple-not-creative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-cor-hypersimple-not-creative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-hypersimple-not-creative — Hypersimple Not Creative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3c41e3442057746\" href=\"?note=a3c41e3442057746\" title=\"90-df-hypersimple-set\">90-df-hypersimple-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40041a5a5d6a4573\" href=\"?note=40041a5a5d6a4573\" title=\"90-df-creative-set\">90-df-creative-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30f3283b9dedba60\" href=\"?note=30f3283b9dedba60\" title=\"90-df-simple-set\">90-df-simple-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5cdab62986807336\" href=\"?note=5cdab62986807336\" title=\"90-thm-smn\">90-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSimple}\">\\(\\mathrm{HSimple}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a3c41e3442057746\" href=\"?note=a3c41e3442057746\" title=\"90-df-hypersimple-set\">90-df-hypersimple-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"30f3283b9dedba60\" href=\"?note=30f3283b9dedba60\" title=\"90-df-simple-set\">90-df-simple-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"40041a5a5d6a4573\" href=\"?note=40041a5a5d6a4573\" title=\"90-df-creative-set\">90-df-creative-set</a>。</li>\n<li>所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a> 的编号；有限集合的索引可由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5cdab62986807336\" href=\"?note=5cdab62986807336\" title=\"90-thm-smn\">90-thm-smn</a> 在该编号中统一取得，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSimple}(H)\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Creative}(H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HSimple}(H)\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Creative}(H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>反设有全递归生产函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>。用有限列编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 表示有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_d\">\\(D_d\\)</span>，由参数固化取全递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(d)\">\\(h(d)\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{h(d)}=D_d\">\\(W_{h(d)}=D_d\\)</span>。从空集开始，递归定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n=p(h(d_n))\">\\(a_n=p(h(d_n))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{d_0}=\\varnothing\">\\(D_{d_0}=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{d_{n+1}}=D_{d_n}\\cup\\{a_n\\}\">\\(D_{d_{n+1}}=D_{d_n}\\cup\\{a_n\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{n+1}\">\\(d_{n+1}\\)</span> 由追加和重编码有效取得。归纳可得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{d_n}\\subseteq\\overline H\">\\(D_{d_n}\\subseteq\\overline H\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n\\in\\overline H\\setminus D_{d_n}\">\\(a_n\\in\\overline H\\setminus D_{d_n}\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{a_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\{a_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline H\">\\(\\overline H\\)</span> 的无限 c.e. 子集，违反简单性的免疫条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明只需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSimple}(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HSimple}(H)\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}(H)\\)</span> 项；不改变本书主函数形式的 hypersimplicity 定义，也不依赖未定义的“有效生产结构不相容”口号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-hypersimple-set","status":"resolved","id